      "name": "Top Notification Banner",
      "role": "Promotional or migration message bar at very top of page",
      "description": "Thin (1px) strip with a subtle gradient background (violet to warm). PPNeueMontreal 12px weight 400 in white text. Centered or left-aligned content with inline link and optional CTA. This is the only place where the gradient system appears at a structural level."
