      "role": "Hero and feature section right-side visuals",
      "description": "Light #e6daff Wisteria Tint background panel with floating product UI cards inside. The cards are white with 2px radius and thin #e3e3e3 borders, containing miniature line charts, status badges, and service names. The tinted background creates a 'stage' for the product preview without using heavy elevation."
