      "name": "Dropdown / Select Input",
      "role": "Form controls in step illustrations and actual UI",
      "description": "White fill, 1px #e3e3e3 border, 2px radius. PPNeueMontreal 14px weight 400 in #0d0d0d for value text, #6b6b6b for placeholder. 10-12px padding. No focus ring visible in static state — relies on border darkening to #0d0d0d on interaction."
